│ "Concepts of patients with alopecia areata about their disease", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Alopecia areata (AA) is a   │
│ common and chronic skin disease with an unknown etiology. It may significantly affect the patient quality of life.   │
│ This study was designed to evaluate the illness perception in patients with AA. METHODS A questionnaire consisting   │
